  "scope": "Separately versioned actor-visible material reference vocabulary after accepted A3. Read-only prerequisite, not a complete request/cartesian domain, native comparison, eligibility, TD5 admission, choice or execution.",
  "observed_before_registration": "Read-only intake inspected the first complete paid observation in each setting and all fresh target values: 8 canonical/10 workflow; three revision-2 targets in each. Original exploratory print attempted unsupported Particular serialization and stopped; corrected formatting only. No engine/test body executed.",
  "grammar": [
    "Pin setting, complete native/refresh/view identities against all twelve accepted A3 records. The policy receives only immutable ParticipantView and refresh text; independent audit also hashes actual native text.",
    "Expose no material vocabulary or new observations unless refresh.phase is complete. Before, inspect-partial, read-partial and cancelled remain empty; completed/restarted projections must be byte-identical.",
    "Direct material evidence: group particulars by exact source, require unique nonconflicting field values, exact-int quantity (bool excluded), ObjectId owner and custodian. Include foreign, damaged, depleted and unusable material without eligibility filtering.",
    "Fresh observation evidence: for every A3 refresh receipt derive its exact delivery; require one matching complete actor-owned read receipt with required/completed/spent all 2 and exact observation input; exact source, actor, context, primitive inspect, outcome succeeded, ObjectRef target and ObjectId owner/custodian. All facts/proof addresses remain on the observation, never merged into target.resolve.",
    "Union direct material source refs with these explicitly paid observed target refs. Canonical uses maximum explicitly evidenced revision per identity; workflow retains all exact revisions. Preserve every original supporting ref, kind, source/delivery/key and observation fact separately.",
    "Emit None plus stable typed-sorted alternatives for canonical stock/tool/repair_stock or workflow stock. Same permissive material vocabulary for these roles is NOT capability or permission.",
    "Never query physical state, regenerate old wrappers, change native access/receipts/history/demand/cursor/acquisition, or reuse previous comparison receipts for changed inputs. No old selector/policy label changes."
  ],
